yaml/structured
description: Composite value that nests other YAML values
- >
  The structured shapes of YAML are the keyed **mapping** and the positional **sequence**, each
  writable in two spellings - the indentation-based block style and the JSON-like flow style.
  See the subchapters below for the two shapes:
- *: 00-yaml_mapping
- *: 01-yaml_sequence
